@codex review

The per-layer request scan finding is fixed and its regression passes on current head 2556d6153c. The documented GB300 backend comparisons remain the GPU correctness evidence; this rerun was CPU-only.

-Robot

Applied upstream fixture fix #47537 in 807e2c15e1, clearing the shared CPU shard failure (`output_ids_offsets` missing from the Rust-server test payload). Packing plus Rust-server fixture coverage passes 11 tests and 14 subtests. The earlier 22 GB300 backend comparisons remain the GPU correctness evidence. Updated the description; fresh CI follows the push.

@ispobock Could you review the ragged-boundary and captured-width fixes? This should land before dependent #43417.

-Robot

